      "retained_constraint_rationale": "The full application says stated light-drizzle weather and Umbrella need, explicitly referring to this same base scene weather selected in the full EN light drizzle that barely needs an umbrella canonical fact. The application is a partial restatement; it does not itself restate the full barely-needs degree. Its independently existing same scene is directly grounded separately by sceneP at this own field. The whole application retains that umbrella need is evaluative description, supplies no umbrella owner/presence/addition, and warrants no safety conclusion. These limits qualify interpretation of the canonical weather selection, add no new executable predicate/fact/guard/role/effect/permission and do not authorize changing props. The complete source weather E, same actual scene owner, exact source/binding conditions and atmosphere permission remain independently required. No foreign field is forced to be a complete degree anchor."
