  "manual_semantic_assessment": "Full original/current/app/weather spec/old5B/own binding/empty closure and SHA-equal whole original reread. EN and KO both make a qualitative negligible/minimal umbrella-need evaluation of light drizzle, not a numeric threshold or physical safety guarantee. KO may phrase no need rather than EN barely needs; neither is recast as an absolute meteorological safety rule. Full own-language direct quotes support their canonical selected weather facts. The app only partially restates that weather while independently fixing actual existing scene; its complete evaluative/no-addition/no-safety limits survive in the exact full reference quote and rationale. Thus this bounded design can address the old false complete app-degree anchor without editing source, deleting an E or demoting it to P/C. Reference is one hop to a directly supported same-CID/same-RID EN fact, not new semantic inference or guard. Any downstream execution of source limits remains independently subject to the full contract; no new predicate is claimed from the rationale.",
